OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATributes as wife and daughter of
OL,4,ADUP chairman Lord Morrow die hours
OL,5,Aapart
OL,6,
OL,7,FSympathies have been expressed to a
OL,8,Fsenior Democratic Unionist Party (DUP)
OL,9,Fpolitician following the death of his
OL,10,Fwife and daughter within hours of each
OL,11,Fother.
OL,13,FThe party said Lord Morrow, who is
OL,14,Fchairman of the DUP, lost his wife Lady
OL,15,FJennifer Morrow and their daughter
OL,16,FRachel Burrows at the weekend.
OL,18,FDUP leader Gavin Robinson said that
OL,19,F"words cannot adequately express the
OL,20,Fheartbreak and sorrow felt across our
OL,21,Fparty".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
